{"4641670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mountain Surfer Drone Racing Game", "steam_appid": 4641670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FPV CONTROLLER IS REQUIRED. <br><br>Mountain Surfer is an FPV drone racing game set in beautiful mountain landscapes. Race courses designed for pilots of every skill level, from beginner to expert, while developing the skills needed for real-world mountain flying. Flying in the mountains means encountering strong winds, turbulence, and rapidly changing air conditions. Mountain Surfer recreates these challenges with authentic mountain air, including updrafts, downdrafts, thermals, rotor turbulence, and unpredictable wind gusts. Race against the clock, improve your skills, or explore the mountains in free flight without risking your drone.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FPV CONTROLLER IS REQUIRED. <br><br>Mountain Surfer is an FPV drone racing game set in beautiful mountain landscapes. Race courses designed for pilots of every skill level, from beginner to expert, while developing the skills needed for real-world mountain flying. Flying in the mountains means encountering strong winds, turbulence, and rapidly changing air conditions. Mountain Surfer recreates these challenges with authentic mountain air, including updrafts, downdrafts, thermals, rotor turbulence, and unpredictable wind gusts. Race against the clock, improve your skills, or explore the mountains in free flight without risking your drone.</p>", "short_description": "FPV CONTROLLER IS REQUIRED! Mountain Surfer is an FPV drone racing game set in beautiful mountain landscapes. Race courses for beginners through expert pilots, select courses feature authentic mountain air: updrafts, downdrafts, thermals, etc, and unpredictable wind gusts.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.